        "Description": "It&apos;s well known that Agent 420 likes his gardening. On a trip to Colombia he got caught snooping around Rico Delgado&apos;s garden. He managed to get away, but five people know about his presence in town now. This leaves us with only one thing to do... Eliminate them!\r\rWinner&apos;s Club Contract created by KkennyZ for Agent 420.",
